# Copy to .env (gitignored). Nothing here is committed.
#
# The agent (every edit decision) runs on DeepSeek and needs no key here — it comes from
# ~/.dsh/.credentials.yaml.
#
# DeepSeek has no speech-to-text endpoint, so transcription is the one capability that
# needs something else. Local whisper is the default and needs no key at all.
# Set this only if you choose the hosted accelerator:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-…
